claims/CLAIMS.md:23:| WI | Truncated symmetry telescopes to two boundary-bond insertions: as **window vectors** `U_R(g)\|ψ_Λ⟩ = e^{i\|R\|θ_α(g)}\|ψ_Λ(T_R^{(g)})⟩` with `V_α(g)^{-1}` on `∂_-R`, `V_α(g)` on `∂_+R`, `A_{g·α}` inside `R` — requiring `Λ ⊇ [a−1,b+1]` **or** D1(e) edge-bond insertions; as **states**, the same with **no phase** | PROVED | D1–D3 | theory/corner-a.md ⟨1⟩3 | theory/checks/corner_a_check.py C1, C1b, C2, C2b |
