*Justification.* Lemma IT (corner-a.md ⟨1⟩2(i)), D2(b),(e), ⟨2⟩1; named
computation **IDX-ρ.2**.

**⟨2⟩3.** (θ=2π.)  (INT) gives `u(2π)=c𝟙`, so (IT) reads
