+
+*Justification.* D27's spectral resolution; `fcs_check.py` **FCS-C4**.
+
+**⟨2⟩5. QED.**
+
+**Noncommutative warning.**  Formula (FCS.4) is special to order two.
+For `n≥3`, (FCS.2) is the safe formula: replacing it by
