+`Q_-=dΓ(P_-)+cI`, `Q_+=dΓ(P_+)+cI`, where `P_±` are one-particle
+orthogonal projections (the second may be the Heisenberg evolution of the
+first under a quadratic number-conserving Hamiltonian).  The initial state is
