+
+**⟨2⟩4.** Insert ⟨2⟩3 into the mixed-state version of (FCS.1), move `ρ_C`
+cyclically to the front of the trace, use
+`e^{itdΓ(P)}=Γ(e^{itP})`, and apply ⟨2⟩2.  The resulting one-particle product
