+
+### ⟨1⟩6. PROPOSITION FCS-D16-SCOPE (why FCS-FREE is not a D16 theorem)
+
+**ASSUME.** D16, in particular `Δ>1`.
+
+**PROVE.** The standard Jordan--Wigner representation of the D16 Hamiltonian
