+**⟨2⟩5.** Define the symmetric law
+`p_{+n}=p_{-n}=[2ζ(3)n³]^{-1}` for `n≥1` and `p_0=0`.  Its total mass is
+one, its absolute first moment is `ζ(2)/ζ(3)<∞`, and its second moment is
