+
+*Justification.* Claim M-INDEX-spec's H-AD-G reduction and D18(AD2); this is
+the same Bernoulli arithmetic as memory-index.md **IDX-RED.1**.
+
+**⟨2⟩3.** For the translate hypothesis, substitute `ν=μ+d` in the
